{"id":"632824","name":"玉米面馒头","author":"どら","authorId":"10454906","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/632824/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米面","amount":"50克"},{"name":"低粉","amount":"250克"},{"name":"温水","amount":"100克"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"3克"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"20克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白糖加玉米面搅拌均匀。","img":"images/632824/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入100克温水。","img":"images/632824/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入两个鸡蛋，3克酵母粉。","img":"images/632824/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌均匀加入低粉。","img":"images/632824/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/632824/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖湿布发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/632824/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉成光滑面团，放入纸托。","img":"images/632824/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"发酵至两倍大，大火蒸20分钟，焖五分钟。","img":"images/632824/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632824/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632824/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632824/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}